OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigators say councillor
OL,4,Abreached conduct code
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK Leicestershire county
OL,7,Fcouncillor breached the authority's
OL,8,Fcode of conduct in social media posts,
OL,9,Finvestigations have found.
OL,11,FJoseph Boam faces two complaints, one
OL,12,Flodged by a former senior council
OL,13,Fofficer and the other by a Conservative
OL,14,Fcouncillor, which will be discussed at
OL,15,Fmember conduct panel hearings on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
