OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigators say councillor
OL,4,Abreached conduct code
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigations, carried out ahead of
OL,7,Fthe meetings, concluded Boam failed to
OL,8,Ftreat former council monitoring officer
OL,9,FLauren Haslam with respect and,
OL,10,Fseperately, brought the authority into
OL,11,Fdisrepute with posts about a row over
OL,12,Fbus routes.
OL,14,FBoam has denied breaching the code of
OL,15,Fconduct and called the complaint
OL,16,Fprocess "a ridiculous waste of taxpayer
OL,17,Fmoney".
